WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:27.149
Peter ate the last carrot.

2
00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:31.641
Then he rubbed his belly.

3
00:00:31.642 --> 00:00:35.468
"I'm still hungry," he said.

4
00:00:35.469 --> 00:00:41.285
"Me too!" said Cotton-tail and Mopsy.

5
00:00:41.286 --> 00:00:49.066
Mrs. Rabbit was in town.

6
00:00:49.067 --> 00:00:54.761
She left some vegetables for her bunnies.

7
00:00:54.762 --> 00:00:59.829
But now the basket was empty.

8
00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:04.196
"Benjamin has a big garden," said Mopsy.

9
00:01:04.197 --> 00:01:17.737
"Let's ask him for some vegetables."

10
00:01:17.738 --> 00:01:27.607
The four bunnies hopped to Benjamin's garden.

11
00:01:27.608 --> 00:01:31.082
"We're hungry," said Mopsy.

12
00:01:31.083 --> 00:01:34.583
"Do you have any vegetables for us?"

13
00:01:34.584 --> 00:01:37.124
Benjamin shook his head.

14
00:01:37.125 --> 00:01:40.175
"I'm sorry," he said.

15
00:01:40.176 --> 00:01:54.164
"I just ate the last pea."

16
00:01:54.165 --> 00:02:06.370
The bunnies hopped home.

17
00:02:06.371 --> 00:02:09.688
"I have an idea," said Peter.

18
00:02:09.689 --> 00:02:13.825
"Let's go to the farmer's trash pile.

19
00:02:13.826 --> 00:02:17.212
There's plenty of food there!"

20
00:02:17.213 --> 00:02:23.366
"Yes!" said Cotton-tail and Mopsy.

21
00:02:23.367 --> 00:02:26.329
Flopsy shook her head.

22
00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:29.968
"Mother will be angry," she said.

23
00:02:29.969 --> 00:02:33.739
"It is not safe.

24
00:02:33.740 --> 00:02:35.710
Father went there.

25
00:02:35.711 --> 00:02:39.537
And he never came home!"

26
00:02:39.538 --> 00:02:44.664
"But we're hungry," said Mopsy and Cotton-tail.

27
00:02:44.665 --> 00:02:56.070
The two bunnies started to cry.

28
00:02:56.071 --> 00:03:02.575
Peter was already hopping toward the door.

29
00:03:02.576 --> 00:03:09.680
"Come on, Flopsy," he said.

30
00:03:09.681 --> 00:03:17.737
"Let's go!"
